        "filing_date": "2026-02-24",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We are subject to various federal, state, local and international laws and regulations relating to the development, manufacture, sale and distribution of our products and services, and it is our policy to comply with the laws in every jurisdiction in which we conduct business.",
        "start_character": 25832,
        "end_character": 26109
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-066820",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-066820-c418526518846f1a",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-066820",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-24",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We characterize our broad and unique offering as Surround the Wafer® to reflect the technology enablement we provide across almost every major process in semiconductor manufacturing today.",
        "start_character": 5708,
        "end_character": 5896
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-066820",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-066820-c418526518846f1a",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-066820",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-24",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We consider our lean manufacturing techniques and responsiveness to customers’ significantly fluctuating product demands to be a competitive advantage.",
        "start_character": 21029,
        "end_character": 21180
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-066820",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-066820-c418526518846f1a",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-066820",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-24",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We continue to develop our products as we strive to meet our customers’ evolving needs.",
        "start_character": 17032,
        "end_character": 17119
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-066820",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-066820-c418526518846f1a",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-066820",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-24",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We have developed the following two product strategies that have been instrumental in delivering value to our customers and helping them solve their most complex problems:",
        "start_character": 2151,
        "end_character": 2322
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-066820",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-066820-c418526518846f1a",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-066820",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-24",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We have developed, and continue to develop, new products to address industry trends, such as the shrinking of integrated circuit critical dimensions and technology inflections, and, in the flat panel display and solar markets, the transition to larger substrate sizes, which require more advanced processing and process control technology, the continuing drive toward more complex and accurate components and devices within the handset, tablet and high performance computing markets, the growth in units and via counts in the HDI PCB and package substrate markets, the industry transition to battery-powered vehicles in the automotive market, and the advancement of AI.",
        "start_character": 17120,
        "end_character": 17789
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-066820",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-066820-c418526518846f1a",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-066820",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-24",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We involve our marketing, engineering, manufacturing and sales personnel in the development of new products in order to reduce the time to market for new products.",
        "start_character": 18296,
        "end_character": 18459
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-066820",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-066820-c418526518846f1a",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-066820",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-24",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We market and sell our products and services through our global direct sales organization, an international network of independent distributors and sales representatives, our websites and product catalogs.",
        "start_character": 15990,
        "end_character": 16195
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-066820",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-066820-c418526518846f1a",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-066820",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-24",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We sell our products and services to thousands of customers worldwide, in a wide range of end markets.",
